{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44806","headline":"别卢使君归故栅村 · 法振","name":"别卢使君归故栅村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归风白马引嘶声，落日犹看楚客情。\n塞口竹缘空戍没，潮头沙拥慢冈成。\n松田且欲亲耕种，郡守何偏问姓名。\n东道宿程投故栅，依依渔父解相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}